I am a non-coder aka vibe-coder so this program is far from being great or just basic maybe but was fun to make.
My system specifications are very limited compared to most others using local ai(my 6gb vram) which puts me in a tough spot,
splitting cpu and gpu between two models allows the chat model to use a 2b params model while the gpu uses 2-4b param model and communicate to each other.
There is still much work to do and things to implement better so for now this is just a WIP that will be refined in time.
